  "engine": "edge",
  "voice": "zh-HK-WanLungNeural",
  "text": "今日你見到嘅書院，係二〇〇八年動工重建、二〇一二年竣工，佔地四千幾平方米，保留咗正門、中堂、奎星樓三進嘅格局。",
  "file": "yue/s2_rebuild_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 69659,
  "md5": "aa1d90ed4dfd451f6781353d0cd56aa0"
 },
 {
  "id": "s3_couplet_mean_v2",
  "lang": "yue",
  "engine": "edge",
  "voice": "zh-HK-WanLungNeural",
  "text": "意思係話，讀書貴在順應時代，通曉古今先算讀書人；呢片土地本就鍾靈毓秀，要在呢度培育出棟樑之才。",
  "file": "yue/s3_couplet_mean_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 61039,
  "md5": "caa861702b14a6ed3dc5f44ad138131b"
 },
 {
  "id": "s3_couplet_v2",
  "lang": "yue",
  "engine": "edge",
  "voice": "zh-HK-WanLungNeural",
  "text": "柱上呢副對聯係：學貴因時，通古今之謂士；地原毓秀，樹梁棟以成材。請跟我讀一次。",
  "file": "yue/s3_couplet_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 58531,
  "md5": "8b9b83e417918d937c920bf91e9c43e0"
 },
 {
  "id": "s3_gate_couplet_v2",
  "lang": "yue",
  "engine": "edge",
  "voice": "zh-HK-WanLungNeural",
  "text": "書院正門仲有一副長聯：鰲海澄波看錦鱗而躍浪，彭峰聳翠兆文筆之生花。寫嘅係呢度出人才嘅底氣。",
  "file": "yue/s3_gate_couplet_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 63233,
  "md5": "8de5e566b0d654858c992b691174579f"
 },
 {
  "id": "s3_intro_v2",
  "lang": "yue",
  "engine": "edge",
  "voice": "zh-HK-WanLungNeural",
  "text": "我哋行入講堂。古時候，學生就坐喺咁樣嘅梁柱之間讀書、寫字、聽先生講學。",
  "file": "yue/s3_intro_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 54456,
  "md5": "eddd8ba546c4747e61ed90dc64d9dc76"
 },
 {
  "id": "s3_three_top_v2",
  "lang": "yue",
  "engine": "edge",
  "voice": "zh-HK-WanLungNeural",
  "text": "狀元莊有恭、榜眼馮願、探花陳伯陶都曾經為書院題寫匾聯，所以佢被稱為東莞唯一有三甲留墨嘅書院。",
  "file": "yue/s3_three_top_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 60098,
  "md5": "fc71baabb2e3874b375083fff1b4f99f"
 },
 {
  "id": "s4_guancao_v2",
  "lang": "yue",
  "engine": "edge",
  "voice": "zh-HK-WanLungNeural",
  "text": "仲有莞草編織。鹹水草喺手上一壓一挑，就變成草蓆、草籃、草帽，呢個係水鄉人家最日常嘅手藝。",
  "file": "yue/s4_guancao_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 64174,
  "md5": "e0566cef920df875aca66e55304fb11f"
 },
 {
  "id": "s4_workshop_v2",
  "lang": "yue",
  "engine": "edge",
  "voice": "zh-HK-WanLungNeural",
  "text": "呢度係非遺工坊。東莞人靠水吃水，一門門老手藝，就係喺咁樣嘅院子傳落嚟。",
  "file": "yue/s4_workshop_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 53516,
  "md5": "8fbf5a77a6d446ae92c7482431a46d4c"
 },
 {
  "id": "s4_xiangyunsha_v2",
  "lang": "yue",
  "engine": "edge",
  "voice": "zh-HK-WanLungNeural",
  "text": "香雲紗又叫莨紗，用薯莨汁反覆浸染，再用河泥覆蓋晾曬，正面烏黑發亮，反面棕紅，著起身沙沙聲。",
  "file": "yue/s4_xiangyunsha_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 60882,
  "md5": "1e633bf3753533d4ca40c258234bfe69"
 },
 {
  "id": "s5_bye_v2",
  "lang": "yue",
  "engine": "edge",
  "voice": "zh-HK-WanLungNeural",
  "text": "我係小鰲，多謝你陪我將呢座書院行咗一次。歡迎下次再嚟，亦歡迎再嚟讀一次嗰副對聯。",
  "file": "yue/s5_bye_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 59158,
  "md5": "2dc2dd6e8b755ae2357d224feccff081"
 },
 {
  "id": "s5_closing_v2",
  "lang": "yue",
  "engine": "edge",
  "voice": "zh-HK-WanLungNeural",
  "text": "五關行完，由明清嘅書聲，到今日嘅手藝，鰲台書院一直守喺呢度，將文脈一代一代傳落去。",
  "file": "yue/s5_closing_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 54299,
  "md5": "b3130a741bc24f5304e43caf0e4ec580"
 },
 {
  "id": "s5_ink_v2",
  "lang": "yue",
  "engine": "edge",
  "voice": "zh-HK-WanLungNeural",
  "text": "古人喺呢度留低墨跡，你都可以留低自己嘅心願。願你似書院嘅學子一樣，讀萬卷書，行萬里路。",
  "file": "yue/s5_ink_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 61196,
  "md5": "19e5475eeefdaa915dd106b586f6117b"
 },
 {
  "id": "s5_route_v2",
  "lang": "yue",
  "engine": "edge",
  "voice": "zh-HK-WanLungNeural",
  "text": "離館前俾你一條參觀路線：正門牌坊、前院天井同假山、講堂楹聯、東側非遺工坊，最後到後園六角亭。",
  "file": "yue/s5_route_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 60882,
  "md5": "b68889fa04ba9b0521905bbc2f3aa92c"
 },
