  "lang": "zh",
  "engine": "qwen",
  "voice": "Serena",
  "text": "厚街粤绣 属于下列哪一类？",
  "file": "zh/relic_houjie_yuexiu_v2_q.mp3",
  "bytes": 15429,
  "md5": "b6442ae2b883d22121d18b3fe1f55406"
 },
 {
  "id": "relic_qingxi_qilin_zhazuo_v2",
  "lang": "zh",
  "engine": "qwen",
  "voice": "Serena",
  "text": "清溪麒麟扎作以竹篾扎出骨架，再糊纸、上彩、绘鳞。麒麟头色彩斑斓、双目灵动，是麒麟舞的核心道具，每逢节庆便随锣鼓起舞。",
  "file": "zh/relic_qingxi_qilin_zhazuo_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 95677,
  "md5": "dd393f2a9f008c8bf156b9465a5f7ef7"
 },
 {
  "id": "relic_qingxi_qilin_zhazuo_v2_no",
  "lang": "zh",
  "engine": "qwen",
  "voice": "Serena",
  "text": "再想想。清溪麒麟扎作 是东莞非遗的代表之一，它就在你面前。",
  "file": "zh/relic_qingxi_qilin_zhazuo_v2_no.mp3",
  "bytes": 40507,
  "md5": "25db9346e279edc535ea00df77a687bb"
 },
 {
  "id": "relic_qingxi_qilin_zhazuo_v2_ok",
  "lang": "zh",
  "engine": "qwen",
  "voice": "Serena",
  "text": "答对了！清溪麒麟扎作 是东莞非遗的代表之一。",
  "file": "zh/relic_qingxi_qilin_zhazuo_v2_ok.mp3",
  "bytes": 34237,
  "md5": "cdd25536964b4f4aeefb252de8f3ff6f"
 },
 {
  "id": "relic_qingxi_qilin_zhazuo_v2_q",
  "lang": "zh",
  "engine": "qwen",
  "voice": "Serena",
  "text": "清溪麒麟扎作 属于下列哪一类？",
  "file": "zh/relic_qingxi_qilin_zhazuo_v2_q.mp3",
  "bytes": 17937,
  "md5": "0aaeca121e1dac2f2c1a7f6e811db7ed"
 },
 {
  "id": "s1_prompt",
  "lang": "zh",
  "engine": "qwen",
  "voice": "Serena",
  "text": "请正对摄像头，让我先认一认你。",
  "file": "zh/s1_prompt.mp3",
  "bytes": 18407,
  "md5": "649c99485ea2fb17a05a90bdc6b650ec"
 },
 {
  "id": "s1_welcome_new_v2",
  "lang": "zh",
  "engine": "qwen",
  "voice": "Serena",
  "text": "欢迎光临鳌台书院，我是你的智能导览员小鳌。这座书院在东莞厚街，是岭南书院文化的代表之一。今天我们走五关，先听书院的故事，再看东莞的手艺。",
  "file": "zh/s1_welcome_new_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 88467,
  "md5": "b4731eabb6066321c20f2fe1048d1c0d"
 },
 {
  "id": "s1_welcome_ok_v2",
  "lang": "zh",
  "engine": "qwen",
  "voice": "Serena",
  "text": "预约访客，欢迎您来到鳌台书院。认出您了，跟好小鳌，我们这就出发。",
  "file": "zh/s1_welcome_ok_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 43798,
  "md5": "f4372eadc3611fc1cb536c4bd66ae91f"
 },
 {
  "id": "s2_move_v2",
  "lang": "zh",
  "engine": "qwen",
  "voice": "Serena",
  "text": "书院最早建在凤林长生庙旁边。到了清朝乾隆年间，老屋年久失修塌了，族人合力把它迁到菊塘坊菊山脚下，乾隆二十一年落成。",
  "file": "zh/s2_move_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 71227,
  "md5": "0f6d884dab8a704b76f1952df96a46f1"
 },
 {
  "id": "s2_origin_v2",
  "lang": "zh",
  "engine": "qwen",
  "voice": "Serena",
  "text": "明朝成化十二年，也就是一四七六年春天，做过宝庆知府的厚街人王恪回到家乡，倡议族人捐资，建起了鳌台书院。",
  "file": "zh/s2_origin_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 73578,
  "md5": "6faae407700a86c279962af7fdf4f874"
 },
 {
  "id": "s2_rebuild_v2",
  "lang": "zh",
  "engine": "qwen",
  "voice": "Serena",
  "text": "今天你看到的书院，是二〇〇八年动工重建、二〇一二年竣工的，占地四千多平方米，保留了正门、中堂、奎星楼三进的格局。",
  "file": "zh/s2_rebuild_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 68249,
  "md5": "10286db7a2127824f1eacf63691092a3"
 },
 {
  "id": "s3_couplet_mean_v2",
  "lang": "zh",
  "engine": "qwen",
  "voice": "Serena",
  "text": "意思是说，读书贵在顺应时代，通晓古今才算读书人；这片土地本就钟灵毓秀，要在这里培育出栋梁之才。",
  "file": "zh/s3_couplet_mean_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 68719,
  "md5": "8795cceba359e06783c6edd1430d44a9"
 },
 {
  "id": "s3_couplet_v2",
  "lang": "zh",
  "engine": "qwen",
  "voice": "Serena",
  "text": "柱子上这副对联是：学贵因时，通古今之谓士；地原毓秀，树梁栋以成材。请跟我读一遍。",
  "file": "zh/s3_couplet_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 61509,
  "md5": "e7ccdf41f9326e8e4198fad56d20a36c"
 },
 {
  "id": "s3_gate_couplet_v2",
  "lang": "zh",
  "engine": "qwen",
  "voice": "Serena",
  "text": "书院正门还有一副长联：鳌海澄波看锦鳞而跃浪，彭峰耸翠兆文笔之生花。写的是这里出人才的底气。",
  "file": "zh/s3_gate_couplet_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 73578,
  "md5": "a68fa7e999ac5dc1b8b3166ac1bc48f7"
 },
 {
  "id": "s3_intro_v2",
  "lang": "zh",
  "engine": "qwen",
  "voice": "Serena",
  "text": "我们走进讲堂。古时候，学生就坐在这样的梁柱之间读书、写字、听先生讲学。",
  "file": "zh/s3_intro_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 51008,
  "md5": "d0348ccc2885a8c35ccd99ba6d69939b"
 },
 {
  "id": "s3_three_top_v2",
  "lang": "zh",
  "engine": "qwen",
  "voice": "Serena",
  "text": "状元庄有恭、榜眼冯愿、探花陈伯陶都曾为书院题写匾联，所以它被称为东莞唯一有三甲留墨的书院。",
  "file": "zh/s3_three_top_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 59158,
  "md5": "9dc03f3f78e021a6a2825b6a0410bd67"
 },
 {
  "id": "s4_guancao_v2",
  "lang": "zh",
  "engine": "qwen",
  "voice": "Serena",
  "text": "还有莞草编织。咸水草在手里一压一挑，就变成草席、草篮、草帽，这是水乡人家最日常的手艺。",
  "file": "zh/s4_guancao_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 61039,
  "md5": "75e6648cbf7ba14e1a0dd063f23612fa"
 },
 {
  "id": "s4_workshop_v2",
  "lang": "zh",
  "engine": "qwen",
  "voice": "Serena",
  "text": "这里是非遗工坊。东莞人靠水吃水，一门门老手艺，就是从这样的院子里传下来的。",
  "file": "zh/s4_workshop_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 47716,
  "md5": "6986360ff1a770b5cdf8cc320077b13e"
 },
 {
  "id": "s4_xiangyunsha_v2",
  "lang": "zh",
  "engine": "qwen",
  "voice": "Serena",
  "text": "香云纱又叫莨纱，用薯莨汁反复浸染，再用河泥覆盖晾晒，正面乌黑发亮，反面棕红，穿起来沙沙作响。",
  "file": "zh/s4_xiangyunsha_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 78907,
  "md5": "f9352f43c01861b6def552acb833d7f4"
 },
 {
  "id": "s5_bye_v2",
  "lang": "zh",
  "engine": "qwen",
  "voice": "Serena",
  "text": "我是小鳌，谢谢你陪我把这座书院走了一遍。欢迎下次再来，也欢迎再来读一遍那副对联。",
  "file": "zh/s5_bye_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 47246,
  "md5": "ff8b62cbe948d78d5fc368965b124d39"
 },
 {
  "id": "s5_closing_v2",
  "lang": "zh",
  "engine": "qwen",
  "voice": "Serena",
  "text": "五关走完，从明清的书声，到今天的手艺，鳌台书院一直守在这里，把文脉一代一代传下去。",
  "file": "zh/s5_closing_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 47246,
  "md5": "c29e5e1df3f5b7e66fa2be6bf6236da1"
 },
 {
  "id": "s5_ink_v2",
  "lang": "zh",
  "engine": "qwen",
  "voice": "Serena",
  "text": "古人在这里留下墨迹，你也可以留下自己的心愿。愿你像书院的学子一样，读万卷书，行万里路。",
  "file": "zh/s5_ink_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 47716,
  "md5": "b6b0748bda9217283360722a603f0722"
 },
 {
  "id": "s5_route_v2",
  "lang": "zh",
  "engine": "qwen",
  "voice": "Serena",
  "text": "离馆前给你一条参观路线：正门牌坊，前院天井和假山，讲堂楹联，东侧非遗工坊，最后到后园六角亭。",
  "file": "zh/s5_route_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 61979,
  "md5": "5534f83af925a04c1823f9ca201e0b9f"
 }
]